@startuml
title Catalog 对象标识：名称只是输入，身份必须稳定

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "采集端输入\nHive / Kafka / RDBMS / 文件" as source #E0F2FE
rectangle "规范化\n大小写、转义、默认库、路径" as normalize #FEF3C7
rectangle "命名空间\n环境 + 集群 + 引擎实例" as namespace #FEF3C7
rectangle "类型内唯一键\ntypeName + qualifiedName" as key #DCFCE7
rectangle "Catalog GUID\n关系、标签、血缘的稳定引用" as guid #DCFCE7

source --> normalize
normalize --> namespace
namespace --> key
key --> guid

note right of source
  displayName 可以重复，
  不能直接拿来做主键
end note

note right of key
  例：
  hive_table
  sales.orders@prod-hive-a
end note

note bottom of guid
  重命名、迁移、重建必须定义语义：
  更新原对象，还是生成新对象并保留映射
end note
@enduml
